<newsitem itemid="780253" id="root" date="1997-08-05" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Willis H1 profits slip to 60.2 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Willis H1 profits slip to 60.2 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr  (pence)		8.0		    vs 10.7</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	  3.3		    vs 3.3</p>
<p> Turnover		    335.8		  vs 365.2</p>
<p> Pretax			60.2		   vs 68.2</p>
<p> Operating result	  58.5		   vs 67.1</p>
<p> Investment/other income 21.1		   vs 21.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits of around 60 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Willis Corroon Group Plc</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7721</p>
</text>
